include baseEmail.pug

block content
  h1 Hi #{firstName},

  p
    | Thank you for choosing
    strong  Natours
    |  for your travel consultation.

  p
    | We're pleased to confirm your consultation request. Below are your appointment details.

  table(role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" width="100%")
    tr
      td
        strong Date
      td #{date}

    tr
      td
        strong Time
      td #{time}

    tr
      td
        strong Meeting Mode
      td #{meetingMode}

  if meetingMode === "online"
    h2 Online Consultation

    p
      |We have Taken Note Of Your Request , We will Give You scheduled Time Soon.

    

   

    
  if meetingMode === "offline"
    h2 Visit Our Office

    p
      | Your consultation will take place at one of our Natours offices.

    p
      | Before visiting, please call the number below. Our support team will guide you to the nearest Natours office based on your location.

    p
      strong Contact Number:
      |  +91 98765 43210

  hr

  p
    | If you have any questions, simply reply to this email.

  p
    | We look forward to helping you plan your next unforgettable journey.

  p
    strong —
    br
    strong The Natours Team